ISO-10303-21;
/* Tfa265: ADVANCED_FACE whose FACE_OUTER_BOUND('outer_bound_empty') carries an empty aggregate in its bound slot — no loop, edge, or curve exists anywhere in the file; the writer emitted () where the boundary reference belongs. The plane and product chain are correct and the bound is reachable through the face */
